{
  "sn1.31:0.1": "Linked Discourses 1.31 ",
  "sn1.31:0.2": "4. The Host of a Hundred Felicities ",
  "sn1.31:0.3": "Virtuous ",
  "sn1.31:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "sn1.31:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "sn1.31:1.3": "Then, late at night, several glorious deities of the host of a hundred felicities, lighting up the entire Jeta’s Grove, went up to the Buddha, bowed, and stood to one side. ",
  "sn1.31:1.4": "Standing to one side, one deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: ",
  "sn1.31:2.1": "“Associate only with the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:2.2": "Try to get close to the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:2.3": "Understanding the true teaching of the good, ",
  "sn1.31:2.4": "things get better, not worse.” ",
  "sn1.31:3.1": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: ",
  "sn1.31:4.1": "“Associate only with the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:4.2": "Try to get close to the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:4.3": "Understanding the true teaching of the good, ",
  "sn1.31:4.4": "wisdom is gained—but not from anyone else.” ",
  "sn1.31:5.1": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presence: ",
  "sn1.31:6.1": "“Associate only with the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:6.2": "Try to get close to the virtuous! ",
  "sn1.31:6.3": "Understanding the true teaching of the good, ",
  "sn1.31:6.4": "you grieve not among the grieving.” ",
  "sn1.31:7.1": "Then another deity spoke this verse in the Buddha’s presenc